s1=The boyy is good.
s2=Girl is good.
s3=Boy and girl both are good.

step1.convert strings to same class

s1=the boyy is good.
s2=girl is good.
s3=boy and girl both are good.

step2.remove all symbols

s1=the boyy is good
s2=girl is good
s3=boy and girl both are good

step3.remove all stopwords

s1= boy good
s2=girl good
s3=boy  girl  good.


